Package: northgate-rmm-server
Version: @VERSION@
Section: admin
Priority: optional
Architecture: amd64
Maintainer: NorthGate RMM maintainers
Depends: adduser, python3 (>= 3.11), python3 (<< 3.12), systemd
Description: private read-only NorthGate RMM control-plane services
 This source-built package carries no deployment authorization.
 Installation on NorthGate requires either the exact bounded V1D
 server-validation authorization and approved post-issued Factory plan, or a
 later exact deployment authorization. V1D permits only synthetic validation
 identities with endpoint routes blocked; G2 is required for any Linux endpoint.
